<title>HONG KONG: Korea Merchant mandates $100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Korea Merchant mandates $100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Merchant Banking Corp has verbally mandated WestLB to arrange a US$100 million floating rate note issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of three years with no put or call options.</p>
<p>The issue will be priced at par to float at 50 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Management fees are 39 basis points giving an all-in return of 63 basis points.</p>
<p>General syndication will start next week.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
